# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# Environment / secrets
# Whole families, not single names (#280): the notifier cutover left a
# `.env.bak-precutover-*` beside the original, holding every token the real file
# holds while matching none of the patterns here. A backup of a secrets file is
# a secrets file. Add a `!.env.example` negation if a committed template lands.
#
# `.env*` rather than `.env` + `.env.*` — the latter needs a literal dot, so it
# missed `.envrc` (CR-11). `notifier.env*` is the other family the credential
# sweep reads: a copy of /etc/watcher/notifier.env keeps that name, and it does
# not begin with `.env` (CR-9). Guarded in lockstep by
# tests/test_env_files_are_not_committable.py — a name that sweep knows to read
# is one git must know to ignore.
.env*
notifier.env*

# Coverage
htmlcov/
.coverage
coverage.xml

